libfusn
------------------------------------------
libfusn is a library for Update Sequence Number (USN) Journal data types.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libfusn-devel-20260522-1bl1
  libfusn1-20260522-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfusn

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfusn/archive/refs/tags/20260522.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfusn-20260522-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfusn-20260522-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfusn-20260522-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfusn-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfusn1-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfusn-devel-20260522-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfusn)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfusn.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfusn/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfusn/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfusn/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfusn/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfusn/README

(libfusn1)
  /usr/bin/cygfusn-1.dll

(libfusn-devel)
  /usr/include/libfusn.h
  /usr/include/libfusn/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libfusn/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfusn/error.h
  /usr/include/libfusn/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfusn/features.h
  /usr/include/libfusn/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfusn.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfusn.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfusn.3.gz

